        "math_refs": [],
        "residual": "The preparation definition does not state minimality of nu, while line 991 claims equivalence to exactly nu stabilizer nullity; this distinction is unresolved.; The measure is written mu_nu in some locations and mu_(n,nu) in others.; Line 1038 asserts |Ker_P(Comp_nu)|=4^n-2^(n-nu), leaving tension with the earlier exact kernel bound and with interpreting small expectations as exact zeros.; The claim of vanishing corrections at line 1039 does not specify a normalization; the displayed additive remainder includes dimension-dependent prefactors.; No uniform-in-sample identity is inferred from the mean formula, and no supplementary or cited-source verification was performed.; Complete component atomization and independent source alignment remain open; no scientific review.; No MathClaim emitted: complete structured binders/conditions were not finalized in this pass. Formula remains in the source-linked semantic context and seed file.",
